==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|dētēctor}}.  Equals {{af|en|detect|-or|pos2=agent noun forming suffix}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/dɪˈtɛktə(ɹ)/|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-detector.wav|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛktə(ɹ)|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[device]] capable of [[register]]ing a specific substance or physical phenomenon, and that optionally sounds an [[alarm]] or triggers a [[warning]].
#: {{ux|en|Smoke '''detectors''' are mandatory in public buildings.}}
## An [[indicator]] showing the [[depth]] of the [[water]] in a [[boiler]].
## A [[galvanometer]], usually [[portable]], for indicating the direction of a [[current]].

